msgstr "Usasishaji Umeghairiwa!"

msgid "Update M3U Playlists from GitHub"
msgstr "Sasisha Orodha za kucheza za M3U kutoka GitHub"

msgid "Update Plugin to new version"
msgstr "Sasisha Programu-jalizi hadi toleo jipya"

msgid "Wait please ..."
msgstr "Subiri tafadhali..."
